get {
  url: {{base_url}}/administrator/bookings/?payment_status=paid&from=2026-09-01&to=2026-09-30&p=1
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:query {
  payment_status: paid
  from: 2026-09-01
  to: 2026-09-30
  p: 1
  ~teacher: 1e54776b-9910-4742-9f8c-8efd23912d4a
  ~search: marco
}

docs {
  ## API explanation
  "Manage Bookings": every purchase, paginated, with the filters the DevPlan asks
  for.

  - `payment_status` -- `pending`, `paid`, `failed`, `refunded`
  - `teacher` -- UUID; keeps purchases that have at least one class with that teacher
  - `from` / `to` -- `YYYY-MM-DD`, on the purchase date
  - `search` -- substring of the student's email

  `GET /administrator/bookings/export/` returns the same rows as a CSV download
  (`vidaverde-bookings-YYYYMMDD.csv`), honouring `payment_status`, `from` and
  `to`.

  ## API example response
  {
    "count": 2,
    "page_size": 10,
    "next": null,
    "previous": null,
    "num_pages": 1,
    "current_page": 1,
    "results": [
      {
        "id": "534a4812-5ff0-4ba1-a136-ab610f9c9e21",
        "package_title": "Spanish Assessment & First Lesson",
        "amount_paid": "12.00",
        "payment_status": "paid",
        "payment_provider": "dummy",
        "payment_reference": "pi_dummy_3603f68905934869ba494e38",
        "paid_at": "2026-09-05T03:44:52.780000-05:00",
        "student_email": "marco.reyes@example.com",
        "student_name": "Marco Reyes",
        "current_spanish_level": "beginner",
